safix::recipient_drift

  × secrets/safix/users/ana/secrets.yaml is not encrypted to the audience
  │ declared for it.
  │ 
  │ Can open it and is not in its audience:
  │   - age1cy
  │ 
  │ Is in its audience and cannot open it:
  │   - age1escrow
  │ 
  │ Nothing was written. A value set now would be wrapped for the recipients
  │ above rather than for the declared audience, and this command commits what
  │ it writes, so a reader the audience no longer names would read a value
  │ minted after their removal straight out of git history.
  │ 
  │ Re-wrap the file to its declared audience, review the diff, then re-run:
  │ 
  │     safix fix
  │     git diff -- secrets/safix/users/ana/secrets.yaml
